 /rb.urgegastropub.com/ -----\n16761 Bernardo Ctr. Dr.\, San Diego\, CA 9212
 8 --- 858-673-8743\n\nWe will be meeting at 6 for dinner and be discussing 
 the Carnival while eating to allow people to get back home on a school nigh
 t!  This meeting will be about the Carnival Breakfast - nothing else unless
  a dire emergency.  Please attend if you can - I have a couple of new Probi
 es that might show up? 
